  'A single elliptical Gaussian + constant on moment-0 is box-dependent (S HCO+ 0.61x0.40" in a 1.2" box -> 0.88x0.58" in 3"; N HCO+ 0.59x0.20" -> 1.5x1.1") and leaves chi 3-5 at N: both nuclei are a compact core + a 1.5-2" pedestal (cf. Sakamoto+2014: N nuclear disk diameter ~2", S compact peak ~0.5" in angular size); '
