  'The r<0.25" aperture gives the same widths within 10% (e.g. HCO+ N 126/152, S 92/98). Gaussian sigma: S 42 (HCO+), 49 (HCN); N 56 (HCO+), 69 (HCN); Bridge 39/35; the off-nuclear clumps E1, E2, W have sigma 23-28 km/s (HCO+). '
